#: src/pages/help/FAQ.tsx
msgid "Your character has eleven skills: accuracy, speed, stamina, jack speed, coordination, release, reading, consistency, concentration, speed jam and memory. Each one levels up on its own, from the parts of a map that test it. A jack-heavy map trains jack speed, a long map trains stamina, and so on. Your overall level grows with all of them."
msgstr "Ton personnage a onze compétences : précision, vitesse, endurance, jackspeed, coordination, release, lecture, régularité, concentration, speed jam et mémoire. Chacune progresse séparément, grâce aux passages d'une map qui la sollicitent. Une map pleine de jacks entraîne le jackspeed, une map longue entraîne l'endurance, etc. Ton niveau global progresse avec toutes."

